cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - given-names: Yoshihiro
    family-names: Ando
    alias: yosh95
title: "SSM Latent World Model (Python/JAX) - Mamba-3 x JEPA"
abstract: >-
  A JAX / Flax NNX port of ssm-latent-rs: Mamba-3 selective state space models
  integrated with a JEPA (Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture) latent world
  model. Includes multi-scale SSM stacks, SIGReg (LeJEPA) collapse prevention,
  LeJEPA identifiability monitors (Theorems 1-4) and a Reptile meta-learning
  framework for evaluating adaptation speed (the SAI core metric).
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
repository-code: "https://github.com/yosh95/ssm-latent-py"
license: MIT
